  "description": "dotnet new templates for assembly projects built with AsmFoundation.Sdk: an assembly library (asmlib), an assembly program (asmexe), a static library (asmstatic), a solution with a C# app, the assembly library it calls and its tests (asmnet), a WebAssembly library (asmwasm), and a solution with a .NET WebAssembly app and the WebAssembly library it calls (asmwasmapp). The projects build for this machine with dotnet build, run with dotnet run, test with dotnet test, and target Windows, Linux and macOS on x64 and ARM64, and WebAssembly.",
